    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is that \"freeing up\" people to do empathy stuff is still expensive. if i can just automate the entire department and save 70% on payroll, isn't that just the smarter move for the company's survival? it feels like keeping people around just for the sake of it is actually bad management.",
